# =============================================================================
# EduSync LMS — Production HTTP Security Headers
# Platform: Netlify / Cloudflare Pages / Vercel (static hosting)
#
# PENTING: File ini hanya berlaku di production static hosting.
# Untuk development server, header dikonfigurasi via vite.config.ts.
#
# CSP Notes:
# - unsafe-eval DIHAPUS di production (tidak dibutuhkan oleh React/Vite runtime)
# - unsafe-inline dipertahankan untuk style (Tailwind + React inline styles)
# - script-src pakai sha256 hash untuk inline bootstrap di index.html
#   (re-compute kalau script diubah — lihat docs/SECURITY.md)
# - localhost entries TIDAK ada di production — dev pakai CSP sendiri via Vite
# - frame-ancestors hanya valid di HTTP header (bukan meta tag)
# =============================================================================

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self' data: blob:; script-src 'self' 'sha256-ywqDASqmqWADASDDV5P+XcmmDbSFoRB5RB6sMP1UVmk=' https://js.sentry-cdn.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; img-src 'self' data: blob: https://api.dicebear.com https://*.r2.cloudflarestorage.com https://cdn.edusync.dev; connect-src 'self' https://sentry.io https://*.sentry.io https://*.r2.cloudflarestorage.com https://cdn.edusync.dev wss:; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com; media-src 'self' blob: https://www.youtube.com https://www.youtube-nocookie.com https://cdn.edusync.dev; frame-src 'self' https://www.youtube.com https://www.youtube-nocookie.com; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; object-src 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-XSS-Protection: 1; mode=block
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
